    "line": 67,
    "kind": "jsx-text",
    "text": "Active Model Version:",
    "key": "ui.s_79b990023f"
  },
  {
    "file": "src/pages/AboutPage.tsx",
    "line": 69,
    "kind": "jsx-text",
    "text": "Trained using two-stage fine-tuning with AdamW optimizer, cosine annealing, and heavy data augmentation to combat laboratory background shortcut learning.",
    "key": "ui.s_7c150d36b4"
  },
  {
    "file": "src/pages/AboutPage.tsx",
    "line": 79,
    "kind": "jsx-text",
    "text": "Dataset Sources & The Field Generalization Gap",
    "key": "ui.s_8f0c87a7dd"
  },
  {
    "file": "src/pages/AboutPage.tsx",
    "line": 84,
    "kind": "jsx-text",
    "text": "Primary Training Set (PlantVillage):",
    "key": "ui.s_2a0f13695d"
  },
  {
    "file": "src/pages/AboutPage.tsx",
    "line": 84,
    "kind": "jsx-text",
    "text": "54,305 controlled laboratory images across 38 classes. While providing rich morphological coverage, lab images feature uniform single-color backgrounds that can cause models to learn background shortcuts.",
    "key": "ui.s_ab877d07e7"
  },
  {
    "file": "src/pages/AboutPage.tsx",
    "line": 87,
    "kind": "jsx-text",
    "text": "Cross-Dataset Evaluation (PlantDoc):",
    "key": "ui.s_ee08245b74"
  },
  {
    "file": "src/pages/AboutPage.tsx",
    "line": 87,
    "kind": "jsx-text",
    "text": "Evaluated against real-world field photographs taken in orchards and farms under variable weather, complex background foliage, and varying light conditions.",
    "key": "ui.s_7afc59bed1"
  },
  {
    "file": "src/pages/AboutPage.tsx",
    "line": 90,
    "kind": "jsx-text",
    "text": "Honest Generalization Gap Disclosure:",
    "key": "ui.s_5cc6fd5a0b"
  },
  {
    "file": "src/pages/AboutPage.tsx",
    "line": 92,
    "kind": "jsx-text",
    "text": "Accuracy on clean lab test sets is typically higher than real-world field images due to overlapping leaves, motion blur, and co-infections in nature. Our model implements explicit confidence thresholding and Shannon entropy rejection to flag ambiguous field samples as 'Uncertain' rather than making false confident predictions.",
    "key": "ui.s_5a59600e77"
  },
  {
    "file": "src/pages/AboutPage.tsx",
    "line": 102,
    "kind": "jsx-text",
    "text": "Farmer Data Privacy & EXIF Stripping",
    "key": "ui.s_7d4bcff067"
  },
  {
    "file": "src/pages/AboutPage.tsx",
    "line": 105,
    "kind": "jsx-text",
    "text": "All image uploads are immediately stripped of embedded EXIF camera and GPS metadata on our server before persistence. Coordinates for weather telemetry are processed in-memory or stored with anonymized user accounts only. Retraining datasets are generated strictly with voluntary farmer opt-in consent.",
    "key": "ui.s_2ff168e676"
  },
  {
    "file": "src/pages/AboutPage.tsx",
    "line": 113,
    "kind": "jsx-text",
    "text": "Agricultural Safety Disclaimer & Limitations",
    "key": "ui.s_f93a83907c"
  },
  {
    "file": "src/pages/AboutPage.tsx",
    "line": 116,
    "kind": "jsx-text",
    "text": "Advisory Decision-Support:",
    "key": "ui.s_da1d761402"
  },
  {
    "file": "src/pages/AboutPage.tsx",
    "line": 116,
    "kind": "jsx-text",
    "text": "This software is an informational tool and does not substitute for certified in-person crop consultants or government plant pathology laboratories.",
    "key": "ui.s_825462fc16"
  },
  {
    "file": "src/pages/AboutPage.tsx",
    "line": 117,
    "kind": "jsx-text",
    "text": "Pesticide Regulations:",
    "key": "ui.s_639e4ef1fd"
  },
  {
    "file": "src/pages/AboutPage.tsx",
    "line": 117,
    "kind": "jsx-text",
    "text": "Pesticide active ingredients and controls listed are generic categories. Chemical registrations vary by state and nation. Always read the physical chemical product label and observe Pre-Harvest Intervals (PHI) and Re-Entry Intervals (REI).",
    "key": "ui.s_77db47a730"
  },
  {
    "file": "src/pages/AboutPage.tsx",
    "line": 118,
    "kind": "jsx-text",
    "text": "Environmental Weather Risk:",
    "key": "ui.s_47709278f3"
  },
  {
    "file": "src/pages/AboutPage.tsx",
    "line": 118,
    "kind": "jsx-text",
    "text": "Outbreak risk scores are transparent agronomic heuristics combining temperature windows, high-humidity hours, and rainfall proxies. They are advisory estimates, not guaranteed forecasts.",
    "key": "ui.s_8a70460c60"
  },
